O:England, 1982
N:Verse and chorus tune. Melody from the lead-vocal line of a MIDI arrangement (hamienet.com, track 4110, channel 11, lowest voice of the doubled harmony; the verse also matches track 352472852771457 channel 3); chords from its keyboard and bass channels (C F, here F Bb). Transposed up a fourth from C to F so the range is C4 to A5. The long instrumental stretches between verse and chorus are cut to two beats of rest. The hook section (F F G F, 4 bars) is left out because the two arrangements disagree on its first note. Humanized onsets snapped to the sixteenth grid.
